You go all out, trying to burn down your foes as fast as possible.

You gain [+10%, +13%, +15%, +18%, +20% (TL1-5)] attack speed, [+12%, +16%, +19%, +21%, +23% (TL1-5; STR 100; DEX 100)] critical chance and [+24%, +28%, +31%, +33%, +35% (TL1-5; STR 100; DEX 100)] physical resistance penetration, but this talent drains 6 stamina each turn.

This effect is disabled automatically on rest or run.
